    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">this genre was a bad matchup for me, I never managed to come up with enough activities and NPCs to fill out the time. So unfortunately I never managed to finish it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yuuki is a raising simulation game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have been tasked with looking after an orphaned foxgirl from the Beastkin race for a few months.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, it is clear they don't think much of her, and her prospects for the future are bad... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you take this child and help her turn things around in just a few short months? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What kind of future will you help her achieve?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Teach her various skills; including Archery, Crafts, and Cooking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Impart knowledge on first aid, herbology, and looking after a forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help her learn interpersonal relationships through jobs and friendships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let her fight in the arena? Can do! It has state of the art magic technology to keep participants safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help her overcome herself and gain the confidence to seize control of her future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A cute and heartfelt story, with fluffy tails and headpats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158740/extras/6ea47beb0dce5f00dae02cbe0a97ff77.poster.avif?t=1740310876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158740/extras/6ea47beb0dce5f00dae02cbe0a97ff77.webm?t=1740310876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is an early access title. Since I want to get feedback on what players want adding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Made with RPGMAKER VX ACE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resolution: 1280x720</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">this genre was a bad matchup for me, I never managed to come up with enough activities and NPCs to fill out the time. So unfortunately I never managed to finish it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yuuki is a raising simulation game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have been tasked with looking after an orphaned foxgirl from the Beastkin race for a few months.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, it is clear they don't think much of her, and her prospects for the future are bad... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you take this child and help her turn things around in just a few short months? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What kind of future will you help her achieve?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Teach her various skills; including Archery, Crafts, and Cooking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Impart knowledge on first aid, herbology, and looking after a forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help her learn interpersonal relationships through jobs and friendships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let her fight in the arena? Can do! It has state of the art magic technology to keep participants safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help her overcome herself and gain the confidence to seize control of her future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A cute and heartfelt story, with fluffy tails and headpats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158740/extras/6ea47beb0dce5f00dae02cbe0a97ff77.poster.avif?t=1740310876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158740/extras/6ea47beb0dce5f00dae02cbe0a97ff77.webm?t=1740310876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is an early access title. Since I want to get feedback on what players want adding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Made with RPGMAKER VX ACE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resolution: 1280x720</p>",
